===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[October]] [[surprise]]}}

# {{lb|en|US|politics}} An [[unexpected]], but [[popular]], [[political]] act carried out just prior to a [[November]] [[election]], in an [[attempt]] to win [[vote]]s.

====Usage notes====
This is frequently meant to represent a scandal involving a candidate that may tank their chances without having time for recovery.

